},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"},"weight":{"reviewState":"pending-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"49"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A character from the London chapter."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Handicraft, gifts"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite food: She likes any food."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hated food: None."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Affiliation: Student council president, Regular Class 1-B."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She and Ricca are like a kind of rivals."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12824"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"知識豊富で成績は飛び抜けて優秀な風見鶏の生徒会長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも穏やかで面倒見が良い性格なので、生徒たちからの人気も絶大。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのナイスバディと相まって、特に男子生徒からは熱い視線が向けられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お気に入りの相手にはプレゼントをする趣味があり、シャルルさんからのプレゼントは風見鶏生たちの憧れのアイテムとなっているらしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4376","sourceWorkId":"17893","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"知識豊富で成績は飛び抜けて優秀な風見鶏の生徒会長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも穏やかで面倒見が良い性格なので、生徒たちからの人気も絶大。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのナイスバディと相まって、特に男子生徒からは熱い視線が向けられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お気に入りの相手にはプレゼントをする趣味があり、シャルルさんからのプレゼントは風見鶏生たちの憧れのアイテムとなっているらしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4376","sourceWorkId":"18078","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"好きな食べ物：なんでもよく食べます　 嫌いな食べ物：なんでもよく食べます"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"風見学園付属 3年2組、新聞部所属。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一つ年上のいとこで、今は清隆と一緒に団地に住んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"清隆のことを溺愛し、スキンシップの激しさもあって、清隆はちょっと反応に困ることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"色々と清隆の面倒をみたがるけど、料理の腕が……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"シャルルという男の子っぽい名前はお父さんがこだわって付けてくれたもので、本人も気に入ってるご様子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ねえねえ、タカくん、知ってた？　いとこ同士って結婚できるんだって！　よ～し、がんばるぞ～」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14419"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14419","value":"編み物"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"weight":[{"comparisonValue":"49","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12824","value":"49"},{"comparisonValue":"49","scope":"sourceWork","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4376","sourceWorkId":"17893","value":"49"},{"comparisonValue":"49","scope":"sourceWork","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4376","sourceWorkId":"18078","value":"49"},{"comparisonValue":"49","scope":"sourceWork","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4376","sourceWorkId":"22122","value":"49"},{"comparisonValue":"52","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14419","value":"52kg"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/489df0806138c96fdf62e202e76f2055f3a44b705a63e7bdf1fb25b006eddfea.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4f0601ba654467afe021e9c409844553c1b354f21eb0ee116dfca299f2080f46.webp","width":107,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤邑 鈴香","creatorId":"vndb:s2309","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2309","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2309","name":"藤邑鈴香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:91724","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c4058","characterName":"アイシア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"57442","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"214115"},{"characterId":"57442","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"3681"},{"characterId":"57442","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"3903"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14707"],"vndbCharacterId":"c4058"},"originalCharacterName":"アイシア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1206"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"71"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"141"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"72"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"48"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"33"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Her grandma, Santa Claus"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Staying still, difficult stuff"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"According to the anime series, Aisia had once visited the Hatsune Island about fifty years ago. At that time she gave a lot of trouble to her friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Now, within the events of D.C.II P.C., Aisia returned to Hatsune Island after a long travel. Like Sakura, she is still young, beautiful and energetic. However, the endless roams around the world and anti-social lifestyle have made her lonely. Can Yoshiyuki brighten up her solitude somehow?"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4058"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アッシュブロンドの髪とルビーのような瞳を持つ外国人の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"商店街で手作り玩具の露店を開いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い体つきに見えるけど、実は義之たちよりもだいぶお姉さんで、昔、風見学園に通ってたこともあると言う。それがホントかウソかはわからないけど、謎の人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「よ～し、がんばるぞ～！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14707","sourceWorkId":"11556","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アッシュブロンドの髪にルビー色の瞳を持つ北欧出身の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"芳乃家に居候し、姑、小姑のちょっかいに負けず、義之のいちゃいちゃ生活を送っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何事にも一生懸命だけど、一生懸命すぎて暴走してしまうのが玉に瑕。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あの時、お店じゃ出来なかったご奉仕……し、してあげる」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14707","sourceWorkId":"12880","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"商店街で目撃されると噂の不思議な少女。誰かに似ているような？"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14707","sourceWorkId":"25266","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"コミック『D.C.S.G.』から登場。北欧から風見学園へ転校してきた少女。アッシュブロンドの髪と緑色の大きなリボンが特徴的。立派な魔法使いになって人々を幸せにするために純一とさくらの祖母に魔法を教わろうと初音島にやって来た。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『D.C.S.S.』ではメインヒロイン。コミックでは物静かな性格で描かれていたが、こちらでは天然ボケな面もある明るいキャラクターで登場した。とてもドジだが誰かを幸せにしたいという思いは本物、アリスとサーカスをやったように運動神経はいい。思い込みが激しく、純一を大魔法使いと勘違いして「御主人様」と呼び、魔法を教えるようしつこく食い下がっていたが本当に未熟な魔法使いだと知ると「純一」と呼び捨てになった。当初は魔法の力を過信し、魔法の危険性を説くさくらと衝突することもあった。美春やアリスと仲がいい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"コミック版では魔法の力を過信しすぎるあまり、さくらの忠告を聞こうとせず、また純一への想いから自分も音夢のようになりたくて魔法の桜を復活させて、純一と音夢が恋人であるという記憶を消してしまう。その世界で再び結ばれた純一と音夢の絆の強さから人の想いを知り、その罪悪感から「自分が存在しない世界」を願い、桜を枯らせた。EDでは純一と音夢の結婚式に姿を見せている。アニメ版では経緯は異なり、封印されていたことりの想いを聞いたのをきっかけで魔法の桜を復活させようとする。『D.C.II P.S.』の展開からさくら以外の人間には彼女の記憶は消えているはずだが、純一は覚えていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なお『D.C.F.S.』でもアイシアに似た謎の少女が登場する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『D.C.II』においても、さくらがアイシアらしき少女を回想していることから、『D.C.S.S.』との繋がりが示唆されている。また、同作のサブシナリオでも声や立ち絵はないものの『D.C.F.S.』の謎の少女らしき人物が登場している。『D.C.II P.S.』ではヒロインとして登場することになり、かつて自分に魔法が危険だと忠告したさくらが魔法の桜を復活させたことを知り、義之の前に現れる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"57442"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/63eae1453596b4ae30a656ded4fbececf86c768766929a03d60fb77a36b6ab26.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fa23b4333d6a90c763edb5f10e2f29552b8952f4b13e066c3f5d5f6f70baf053.webp","width":105,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤邑 鈴香","creatorId":"vndb:s2309","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2309","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2309","name":"藤邑鈴香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:91723","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c77481","characterName":"いっちゃん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"67419","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"333293"}],"egsCharacterIds":["21011"],"vndbCharacterId":"c77481"},"originalCharacterName":"いっちゃん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"501"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"174"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"His magic is to display other people face with different expression from real expression in pocket watch. It can be used to display real expression too."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"His specialist magic is to manipulate time from different possibility, parallel universe or timeline and using it to erase or change an event. To use this magic, his magic activity should be accepted by Tokisaka bloodline depend on how big is the scale of an event and there is a possibility that this magic will be sealed by older generation. Originally, this magic have to activated together with stabilization magic to increase the successful rate or it will go berserk."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c77481"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「他人を鏡越しに見ると笑顔に見える」というちょっとメルヘンな魔法を使える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本的にお節介で、面倒がりながらもついつい誰かのために動いてしまうことが多い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21011","sourceWorkId":"27278","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"しゃーないと言いつつ無茶をする主人公"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「他人を鏡越しに見ると笑顔に見える」というちょっとメルヘンな魔法を使える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本的にお節介で、面倒がりながらもついつい誰かのために動いてしまうことが多い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"67419"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/dadfece1f4988